{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you defeat does not disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It changes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shards of Memories</strong>, defeated enemies leave behind memories that carry their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies. Copy their attacks. Make them yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory can be equipped and influences how you fight, move, and unlock new paths. Every enemy can change your playstyle. Every decision shapes your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-drawn world filled with hidden routes, risky shortcuts, and forgotten stories. Progress here means not only reaching new areas, but mastering new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system rewards precision, timing, and adaptability. Study your enemies. Use their abilities. Surpass them with their own memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories are worth keeping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep this one on your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918470?t=1772279104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/99b95dca462e63fb2aacbcae7f8a1c7c6caadf72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772279104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/d9eb991539e04eae323205d93352d8f77bccafb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772279104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/d9eb991539e04eae323205d93352d8f77bccafb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772279104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you defeat does not disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It changes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shards of Memories</strong>, defeated enemies leave behind memories that carry their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies. Copy their attacks. Make them yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory can be equipped and influences how you fight, move, and unlock new paths. Every enemy can change your playstyle. Every decision shapes your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-drawn world filled with hidden routes, risky shortcuts, and forgotten stories. Progress here means not only reaching new areas, but mastering new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system rewards precision, timing, and adaptability. Study your enemies. Use their abilities. Surpass them with their own memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories are worth keeping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep this one on your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Iron Twelve Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/ae4f5bd13b94c851bede42452e621cd61401b9f8/header.jpg?t=1772279104","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3918470/1929386594/e052b257f07b1014a1690f68e5d5c35fa13fad78/1771871234/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771872787","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3918470/1929386594/e052b257f07b1014a1690f68e5d5c35fa13fad78/1771871234/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771872787","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3918470/1929386594/e052b257f07b1014a1690f68e5d5c35fa13fad78/1771871234/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771872787